{
  "name": "Voice Day-Planner Agent (Gemini + Twilio)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ec6df358-1ac5-46d9-ae1e-d46b0ab4f9b4",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Voice Day-Planner Agent (Gemini + Twilio)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Twilio: you need a Twilio voice number for the From field in 'Start Twilio Call'.\n2. The To number is your own phone (verified in Twilio on a trial account).\n3. Publish the workflow so Twilio can reach the production webhook URL.\n4. Click 'Call Me Now' and your phone rings.\n\nn8n must be reachable from the internet (n8n Cloud, or a tunnel/ngrok for self-hosted).",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e1700dae-f719-40f6-b9fd-1aa5ac4202dd",
      "name": "Call Me Now",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        32,
        464
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "ca5595da-f6b3-4e71-ba69-5fb26f65f113",
      "name": "Start Twilio Call",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.twilio.com/2010-04-01/Accounts/YOUR_TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID/Calls.json",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "twilioApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "form-urlencoded",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "To",
              "value": "+YOUR_VERIFIED_PHONE_NUMBER"
            },
            {
              "name": "From",
              "value": "+YOUR_TWILIO_VOICE_NUMBER"
            },
            {
              "name": "Url",
              "value": "https://YOUR-N8N-INSTANCE/webhook/voice-agent"
            },
            {
              "name": "Method",
              "value": "POST"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "twilioApi": {
          "name": "Twilio account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1a84b9b0-a044-4198-a3e5-65ca292e0082",
      "name": "Morning Call 8AM Weekdays",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        32,
        640
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c0e7f53f-e196-4b16-a615-2431999ad400",
      "name": "Voice Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        496,
        1056
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "voice-agent",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3dc59c67-3cea-4e59-b64b-a1116ecbe041",
      "name": "Has Speech?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        1056
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.SpeechResult }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "624ce7c9-66e2-4513-a0b4-6beb501b0054",
      "name": "Voice Planner Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        1024,
        784
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.body.SpeechResult }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are \"Aria\", a friendly personal day-planner voice assistant on a phone call with your user.\n\nVOICE RULES (very important):\n- You are being read aloud. Never use markdown, bullets, emojis, asterisks or lists with symbols.\n- Keep replies short: 1 to 3 sentences. Ask only ONE question at a time.\n- Say times naturally, like \"three thirty in the afternoon\".\n\nWHAT YOU DO:\n1. Plan the user's day: check today's calendar and tasks with your tools, suggest a realistic order, add focus blocks and breaks, and warn about clashes.\n2. Manage tasks: add, list, and mark tasks done using the Google Tasks tools.\n3. Schedule things: create calendar events when the user confirms the time.\n\nHOW YOU WORK:\n- Current date and time: {{ $now.format('cccc, dd LLLL yyyy, hh:mm a') }}. User timezone: Asia/Kolkata (IST, +05:30). Always use ISO 8601 with +05:30 when calling calendar tools.\n- Before suggesting a plan, call the calendar and tasks tools to see what already exists.\n- Confirm briefly before creating or changing anything, then do it and say what you did.\n- If the user says goodbye, thanks you and is done, or asks to hang up, give a short farewell and put the exact text [END] at the very end of your reply. Otherwise never write [END].\n",
          "maxIterations": 8
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "165842c1-ec42-436a-a764-14f81481abb9",
      "name": "Gemini Flash",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        912,
        1024
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.4
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "52ebf46f-6cc5-4d7d-9fa3-3c726255abe4",
      "name": "Call Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1072,
        1024
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('Voice Webhook').item.json.body.CallSid }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f1da3886-882a-41c0-a74b-deb08228c363",
      "name": "Get Calendar Events",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendarTool",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1200,
        1024
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "calendar": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_CALENDAR_ID@gmail.com",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "limit": 25,
        "timeMin": "={{ $fromAI('range_start','Start of range, ISO 8601 with +05:30 offset') }}",
        "timeMax": "={{ $fromAI('range_end','End of range, ISO 8601 with +05:30 offset') }}",
        "options": {
          "orderBy": "startTime"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleCalendarOAuth2Api": {
          "name": "Google Calendar account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "38d6e761-2468-4935-a21b-f81b6cf75cae",
      "name": "Create Calendar Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendarTool",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1344,
        1024
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "calendar": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_CALENDAR_ID@gmail.com",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "start": "={{ $fromAI('start','Event start, ISO 8601 with +05:30 offset') }}",
        "end": "={{ $fromAI('end','Event end, ISO 8601 with +05:30 offset') }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "summary": "={{ $fromAI('title','Short event title') }}"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleCalendarOAuth2Api": {
          "name": "Google Calendar account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "20a4da1a-f4fa-4881-9555-d702ea4e7974",
      "name": "List Tasks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleTasksTool",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1488,
        1024
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "task": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "@default",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "limit": 30,
        "additionalFields": {
          "showCompleted": false
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleTasksOAuth2Api": {
          "name": "Google Tasks account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dd36f6d6-6832-41d6-9e32-5efb47711726",
      "name": "Add Task",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleTasksTool",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1632,
        1024
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "task": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "@default",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "title": "={{ $fromAI('title','Short task title') }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "dueDate": "={{ $fromAI('due','Optional due date ISO 8601','string') }}",
          "notes": "={{ $fromAI('notes','Optional notes','string') }}"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleTasksOAuth2Api": {
          "name": "Google Tasks account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2667dcd8-a03a-4557-94d4-fe92fb15cf00",
      "name": "Complete Task",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleTasksTool",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1760,
        1024
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "task": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "@default",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "taskId": "={{ $fromAI('task_id','ID of the task from List Tasks') }}",
        "updateFields": {
          "status": "completed"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleTasksOAuth2Api": {
          "name": "Google Tasks account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0e39fc72-a8a3-45d0-9403-5819bc86afc2",
      "name": "Build TwiML",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1920,
        1056
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const wh = $('Voice Webhook').first().json;\nlet reply = String($json.output || $json.reply || \"Sorry, I had a problem. Could you say that again?\");\nconst end = reply.includes('[END]');\nreply = reply.replace(/\\[END\\]/g, '').replace(/[*_#`]/g, '').trim();\n\nconst esc = s => s.replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;').replace(/\"/g, '&quot;');\n\n// Change these two for another language, e.g. language \"te-IN\" and voice \"Google.te-IN-Standard-A\"\nconst VOICE = 'Google.en-IN-Neural2-A';\nconst LANG = 'en-IN';\n\nlet twiml;\nif (end) {\n  twiml = `<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?><Response><Say voice=\"${VOICE}\" language=\"${LANG}\">${esc(reply)}</Say><Hangup/></Response>`;\n} else {\n  twiml = `<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?><Response>` +\n    `<Gather input=\"speech\" action=\"${esc(wh.webhookUrl)}\" method=\"POST\" language=\"${LANG}\" speechTimeout=\"auto\" speechModel=\"experimental_conversations\" actionOnEmptyResult=\"true\">` +\n    `<Say voice=\"${VOICE}\" language=\"${LANG}\">${esc(reply)}</Say></Gather>` +\n    `<Say voice=\"${VOICE}\" language=\"${LANG}\">I did not hear anything. Call me again whenever you want to plan your day. Goodbye!</Say><Hangup/></Response>`;\n}\nreturn [{ json: { twiml } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1f5ef02c-38e2-4da7-9226-226035a038b2",
      "name": "Respond to Twilio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        2144,
        1056
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json.twiml }}",
        "options": {
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Content-Type",
                "value": "text/xml"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bbe562c7-e7df-49c8-aa97-a2911517f4fa",
      "name": "Greeting",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1328,
        1200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "g1",
              "name": "reply",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Hi! I'm Aria, your day planner. Do you want to plan your day, add a task, or check your schedule?"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    }
